-duti-pada-jar-dhana-sampada/","title":"Sāvaraṇa Śrī-Gaura-mahimā"},"next":{"path":"/en/avatara-sara-gora-avatara/","title":"Avatāra Sāra"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":130,"author":"Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur","first_line":"gaurā pahu̐ nā bhajiyā mainu"},"title":["Gaurā Pahu̐"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["gaurā pahu̐ nā bhajiyā mainu","prema ratana-dhana helāya hārāinu"],"translation":["O Lord Gaura! I have not worshipped You and have been robbed of the jewel of divine love by my own negligence."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["adhane yatana kari dhana teyāginu","āpana karama-doṣe āpani ḍubinu"],"translation":["Although I am in need of Your wealth, I have endeavoured to reject Your riches and instead I have dived into sinful material activity."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["sat-saṅga chhāḍi’ kainu asate vilāsa","te-kāraṇe lāgila ye karma-bandha-phā̐sa"],"translation":["Avoiding the association of saintly persons, I have enjoyed sporting with materialistic people. For that reason I have become bound in the noose of fruitive activity and its reactions."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["viṣaya-viṣama-viṣa satata khāinu","gaura-kīrtana rase magana nā hainu"],"translation":["I have perpetually drunk the horrible poison of material sense gratification and have never become absorbed in the sweet nectar of the chanting of Lord Gaura’s Names."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["kena vā āchhaye prāṇa ki sukha lāgiyā","narottama-dāsa kena nā gela mariyā"],"translation":["O why has my heart not experienced any satisfaction and why has Narottam Dās not simply perished?"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gora-panhu-na-bhajiya-mainu","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Gaurā-Pahu-02-22-2"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/gaura-pahu-na-bhajiya-mainu/","description":"Gaurā Pahu̐ — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Gaurā Pahu̐. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"gaura-pahu-na-bhajiya-mainu"}}